	(text "U3 passes data to D0 only while CUTOUT is high, so normal\nDCC load current through R1 never reaches the UART.\nJP1 is bridged 1-2 (D9) by default. Cut it and bridge 2-3\nto pass data all the time."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 53.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "234683dc-0374-4b12-bf2f-6df74e0d3106")
	)
	(text "C1 at U1, C2 at U2, C3 at U3, C4 bulk on 3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "521a735e-84d7-461e-9a47-df9463bc6d25")
	)
	(text "Shield header pins (Metro RP2350):\nD0 = GPIO1, UART0 RX: RailCom data, 250 kbaud 8N1\nD2 / D4 = GPIO2 / GPIO4: current direction (loco orientation)\nD9 = GPIO9, BRAKE_A: high during the cutout (read only)\nSDA / SCL = GPIO20 / GPIO21: passed through to the OLED header J3\n(J3 pinout matches the EX-MotorShield8874 OLED header)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ba07421-a5fa-40ab-b448-11810025389c")
	)
	(text "RailCom detector (RCN-217 section 2.3)\nR1 2.2R x INA240A1 (gain 20): ISENSE = 1.65 V + 44 mV per mA\nR2-R4: VTH_H 2.01 V, VTH_L 1.29 V = about +/-8.2 mA\n(spec: over 10 mA reads 0, under 6 mA reads 1)\nR5-R7 add about 0.5 mA of hysteresis"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80b0b4f4-040d-44b2-bc0c-7836bb62c87d")
	)
